  "description": "Bluebird – The Friendliest Tandem for All\nHandcrafted with pride in Eugene, Oregon, the Bluebird Tandem combines affordable pricing with the signature Co-Motion quality you can trust. Designed to be the most approachable tandem bike in the Co-Motion lineup, the Bluebird makes it easy to share the joy of tandem cycling with your best pal, partner, or even your little one. Whether you're out for a leisurely ride or an adventurous tour, this real, handmade in Eugene, Oregon USA tandem delivers exceptional value without compromising on performance.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels with 28-32mm tires for a smooth, comfortable ride\n\nCo-Motion zonally-butted chromoly tubing for strength and durability\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for precise handling\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for confident long-distance riding\n\nRack & fender mounts for added versatility\n\nDual disc brakes for reliable stopping power\n\nShimano Deore components for smooth and efficient shifting\n\nHand-built 40-hole tandem wheels for lasting performance\n\nColor for 2024/2025: Capri Blue for a fresh, vibrant look\n\nReady to ride with your favorite adventure buddy? The Bluebird Tandem offers unbeatable value, superior quality, and affordable fun—it’s everything you need to make every tandem ride unforgettable.\n\nOffered as a complete bicycle only for $3,849.00\nSee features and specifications below",
